    "text": "&nbsp;The mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math> shown in figure oscillates in simple harmonic motion with amplitude <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>. The amplitude of the point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> is &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<br />\r&nbsp;<br />\r<img alt=\"\" height=\"66\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0007503_Ques1_1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" width=\"294\" />",
